WEBVTT

00:04:58.919 --> 00:05:03.924
(Singing) Uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh oh, no, no,
uh-oh, uh-oh, uh-oh, oh, no, no.

00:05:03.924 --> 00:05:04.925
(Applause and cheers)

00:05:04.925 --> 00:05:06.302
The “Uh-oh” dance.

00:05:06.635 --> 00:05:09.347
Beyoncé called it that
because she was trying to warn us.

00:05:09.347 --> 00:05:10.348
(Laughter)

00:05:10.389 --> 00:05:11.724
Because of Destiny’s Child,

00:05:11.724 --> 00:05:13.684
bootylicious is in the dictionary.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:19.023
And because of Beyoncé’s 2003 music video
for her single “Crazy in Love,”

00:05:19.023 --> 00:05:22.151
the world was introduced
to the “Uh-oh” dance.

00:05:22.777 --> 00:05:26.113
That was the first time I’d ever seen
a popstar do something like that,

00:05:26.113 --> 00:05:27.740
and I wanted to be just like her.

00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:31.118
Beyoncé gave me permission
to be myself ...